tures are based on clunky, outdated tech. Excel and Google Sheets simply don’t provide the features modern finance teams need to build complex and highly adaptable models. On the other hand, incumbent enterprise solutions are powerful but require significant IT overhead, training and user patience.\r\n\r\nIn true contrast stands Pigment, a powerful integrated SaaS platform that vastly improves the financial planning process by focusing on ease of use, short time to value, real-time collaboration, expansive breadth of integrations and outstanding customer support. Pigment presents its impressive features via intuitive dashboards and a visually rewarding graphical user experience that customers love. We’re excited to help this breakthrough company grow into an industry-leading fintech platform that helps companies revolutionize decision-making, visualize complex scenarios, and update them in real time, with a powerful, scalable data engine and an intuitive UI.","Pigment is a business platform that leverages simplicity, short time to value and real-time collaboration to vastly improve the financial planning process.","Pigment - IVP Portfolio - Fintech & SaaS Growth Investors","Pigment - IVP Portfolio  ","A business planning platform for forward-thinking organizations",{"id":25,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"483","2022-09-29","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=25583&v=45","Eléonore Crespo, Romain Niccoli","/content/pigment-the-true-colors-of-next-gen-business-planning/","Read the Funding Announcement","https://www.linkedin.com/company/pigment/",{"id":33,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":34,"assetUrlXs":35,"assetUrlSm":36,"assetUrlMd":37,"assetUrlLg":38,"assetUrlXl":39,"assetUrlXxl":40},"485","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/485/pigment.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/485/xs_pigment.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/u